-- throws click-wait button output "unreachable"
(threw: Error: nested parent defect)
<body>
  <main>
    <button>"launch"</button>
    <output>"idle"</output>
    <aside id="observed">"waiting"</aside>
  </main>
  <div style="position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:2147483647;overflow:auto;margin:0;padding:24px;background:#fff;color:#a00;font:14px/1.5 monospace;white-space:pre-wrap">"This program has stopped.\n\nSomething it ran threw an exception, so its state can no longer be trusted and nothing more of it runs. The exception is below, and in the console with its stack.\n\nError: nested parent defect"</div>
</body>
-- click-wait button aside "nested cleaned"
<body>
  <main>
    <button>"launch"</button>
    <output>"idle"</output>
    <aside id="observed" data-closed="yes">"nested cleaned"</aside>
  </main>
  <div style="position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:2147483647;overflow:auto;margin:0;padding:24px;background:#fff;color:#a00;font:14px/1.5 monospace;white-space:pre-wrap">"This program has stopped.\n\nSomething it ran threw an exception, so its state can no longer be trusted and nothing more of it runs. The exception is below, and in the console with its stack.\n\nError: nested parent defect"</div>
</body>
